@export Under section 202(1), does my circulation of a statement contravene the bar on disseminating information about illegal transactions?
GIVEN
    `the person circulated or disseminated, or authorised or was concerned in the circulation or dissemination of, a statement or information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you circulate or disseminate, or authorise or be concerned in the circulation or dissemination of, a statement or information?
    `the statement or information is to the effect that the price of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of a corporation will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or act that to the person's knowledge was in contravention of section 197, 198, 199, 200 or 201` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement or information to the effect that the price of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of a corporation will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or other act that, to your knowledge, was entered into or done in contravention of section 197, 198, 199, 200 or 201 (or would be if entered into or done)?
    `the statement or information is to the effect that the price of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of a business trust will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or act that to the person's knowledge was in contravention of section 197, 198, 199, 200 or 201` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement or information to the effect that the price of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of a business trust will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or other act that, to your knowledge, was entered into or done in contravention of section 197, 198, 199, 200 or 201 (or would be if entered into or done)?
    `the statement or information is to the effect that the price of a class of derivatives contracts will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or act that to the person's knowledge was in contravention of section 197, 200, 201, 201A or 201B` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement or information to the effect that the price of a class of derivatives contracts will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or other act that, to your knowledge, was entered into or done in contravention of section 197, 200, 201, 201A or 201B (or would be if entered into or done)?
    `the statement or information is to the effect that the price of a class of spot foreign exchange contracts for purposes of leveraged foreign exchange trading will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or act that to the person's knowledge was in contravention of section 197, 200, 201, 201A or 201B` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement or information to the effect that the price of a class of spot foreign exchange contracts for purposes of leveraged foreign exchange trading will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or other act that, to your knowledge, was entered into or done in contravention of section 197, 200, 201, 201A or 201B (or would be if entered into or done)?
    `a condition in subsection (1) is satisfied (the answer under section 202(2))` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the question under section 202(2) answer in your case? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE or NOTHING)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 202(1), does my circulation of a statement contravene the bar on disseminating information about illegal transactions` IS
    `s 202(1) the person's circulation of a statement or information contravenes the bar on disseminating information about illegal transactions` `the person circulated or disseminated, or authorised or was concerned in the circulation or dissemination of, a statement or information` `the statement or information is to the effect that the price of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of a corporation will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or act that to the person's knowledge was in contravention of section 197, 198, 199, 200 or 201` `the statement or information is to the effect that the price of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of a business trust will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or act that to the person's knowledge was in contravention of section 197, 198, 199, 200 or 201` `the statement or information is to the effect that the price of a class of derivatives contracts will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or act that to the person's knowledge was in contravention of section 197, 200, 201, 201A or 201B` `the statement or information is to the effect that the price of a class of spot foreign exchange contracts for purposes of leveraged foreign exchange trading will, or is likely to, rise or fall or be maintained by reason of a transaction or act that to the person's knowledge was in contravention of section 197, 200, 201, 201A or 201B` `a condition in subsection (1) is satisfied (the answer under section 202(2))`

@export Under section 203(1), does my failure to notify the approved exchange contravene the continuous disclosure bar?
