    `s 203(1) the person's failure to notify the approved exchange contravenes the bar on failing to disclose` `subsection (1) applies to the person (the answer under section 203(2))` `the person is required by the approved exchange, under the listing rules or any other requirement, to notify it of information on specified events or matters as they occur or arise` `the person failed to notify the approved exchange of the information required to be disclosed` `the failure was intentional` `the failure was reckless` `the failure was negligent`

