GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 207(1), does my conduct contravene the bar on acts done to create a false or misleading appearance as to a financial benchmark` IS
    `s 207(1) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on conduct done to create a false appearance as to a financial benchmark` `the person did a thing, caused a thing to be done or engaged in a course of conduct` `the purpose or one of the purposes is to create a false or misleading appearance as to the price, value, performance or rate of a financial benchmark`

