    `the thing was done by, or by a person acting on behalf of, a public authority (the answer under section 206)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc Was the thing done, or the course of conduct engaged in, by or on behalf of a public authority? (JUST TRUE or JUST FALSE from the question under section 206 "public authority", or NOTHING if not known)
    `the thing was done by, or by a person acting on behalf of, an international body (the answer under section 206)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc Was the thing done, or the course of conduct engaged in, by or on behalf of an international body? (JUST TRUE or JUST FALSE from the question under section 206 "international body", or NOTHING if not known)
    `the thing was done in respect of monetary policy` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the thing was done in respect of monetary policy?
    `the thing was done in respect of policies with respect to exchange rates, the management of public debt or foreign exchange reserves` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the thing was done in respect of policies with respect to exchange rates, the management of public debt or foreign exchange reserves?
    `the thing was done for the purpose of managing the price or value of a commodity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the thing was done for the purpose of managing the price or value of a commodity?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 208, does section 207 not apply to what I did` IS
    `s 208 section 207 does not apply to the thing done` `the thing was done by, or by a person acting on behalf of, a public authority (the answer under section 206)` `the thing was done by, or by a person acting on behalf of, an international body (the answer under section 206)` `the thing was done in respect of monetary policy` `the thing was done in respect of policies with respect to exchange rates, the management of public debt or foreign exchange reserves` `the thing was done for the purpose of managing the price or value of a commodity`

@export Under section 209, does my statement contravene the bar on false or misleading statements to a person administering a financial benchmark?
GIVEN
    `the person made a statement, disseminated information or expressed an opinion that is false or misleading in a material particular to a person who administers a financial benchmark` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you make a statement, disseminate information or express an opinion that is false or misleading in a material particular to a person who carries out the activity of administering a financial benchmark?
    `the person intends that the statement, information or opinion be used for the purpose of administering a financial benchmark` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you intend that the statement, information or opinion be used for the purpose of administering a financial benchmark?
    `the person knows or ought reasonably to have known that it is false or misleading in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know, or ought you reasonably to have known, that the statement, information or opinion is false or misleading in a material particular?
    `the person is reckless as to whether it is false or misleading in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you reckless as to whether the statement, information or opinion is false or misleading in a material particular?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 209, does my statement contravene the bar on false or misleading statements to a person administering a financial benchmark` IS
    `s 209 the person's statement contravenes the bar on false or misleading statements to a benchmark administrator` `the person made a statement, disseminated information or expressed an opinion that is false or misleading in a material particular to a person who administers a financial benchmark` `the person intends that the statement, information or opinion be used for the purpose of administering a financial benchmark` `the person knows or ought reasonably to have known that it is false or misleading in a material particular` `the person is reckless as to whether it is false or misleading in a material particular`

@export Under section 210(1), what is the most I can be fined on conviction for contravening a provision of Division 2, in dollars?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 210(1), what is the most I can be fined on conviction for contravening a provision of Division 2, in dollars` IS
    `s 210(1) the penalty on conviction for contravening a provision of Division 2`'s `penalty: the highest fine, in Singapore dollars`

§ `Division 3: insider trading (ss 213 to 231)`

@export Under section 215, is the information generally available?
GIVEN
    `the information consists of readily observable matter` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the information consist of readily observable matter?
    `the information has been made known in a manner that would, or would be likely to, bring it to the attention of persons who commonly invest in securities of a kind affected` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the information been made known in a manner that would, or would be likely to, bring it to the attention of persons who commonly invest in securities of a kind of which the price or value might be affected by the information?
    `the information has been made known in a manner that would, or would be likely to, bring it to the attention of persons who commonly invest in securities-based derivatives contracts of a kind affected` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the information been made known in a manner that would, or would be likely to, bring it to the attention of persons who commonly invest in securities-based derivatives contracts of a kind of which the price or value might be affected by the information?
    `the information has been made known in a manner that would, or would be likely to, bring it to the attention of persons who commonly invest in CIS units of a kind affected` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the information been made known in a manner that would, or would be likely to, bring it to the attention of persons who commonly invest in CIS units of a kind of which the price or value might be affected by the information?
    `since it was so made known, a reasonable period for it to be disseminated among such persons has elapsed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since it was so made known, has a reasonable period for it to be disseminated among such persons elapsed?
    `the information consists of deductions, conclusions or inferences made or drawn from readily observable matter` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the information consist of deductions, conclusions or inferences made or drawn from information consisting of readily observable matter?
    `the information consists of deductions, conclusions or inferences made or drawn from information made known as referred to in paragraph (b)(i)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the information consist of deductions, conclusions or inferences made or drawn from information made known as referred to in paragraph (b)(i)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 215, is the information generally available` IS
    `s 215 the information is generally available` `the information consists of readily observable matter` `the information has been made known in a manner that would, or would be likely to, bring it to the attention of persons who commonly invest in securities of a kind affected` `the information has been made known in a manner that would, or would be likely to, bring it to the attention of persons who commonly invest in securities-based derivatives contracts of a kind affected` `the information has been made known in a manner that would, or would be likely to, bring it to the attention of persons who commonly invest in CIS units of a kind affected` `since it was so made known, a reasonable period for it to be disseminated among such persons has elapsed` `the information consists of deductions, conclusions or inferences made or drawn from readily observable matter` `the information consists of deductions, conclusions or inferences made or drawn from information made known as referred to in paragraph (b)(i)`

@export Under section 216, would a reasonable person be taken to expect the information to have a material effect on the price or value?
GIVEN
    `the information would, or would be likely to, influence the persons who commonly invest in deciding whether or not to subscribe for, buy or sell the securities, contracts or units` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the information, or would it be likely to, influence the persons who commonly invest in the securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or CIS units in deciding whether or not to subscribe for, buy or sell them?
    `the information would, or would be likely to, influence one or more classes of the persons who commonly invest in deciding whether or not to subscribe for, buy or sell the securities, contracts or units` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the information, or would it be likely to, influence any one or more classes of persons who constitute the persons who commonly invest in deciding whether or not to subscribe for, buy or sell the securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or CIS units?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 216, would a reasonable person be taken to expect the information to have a material effect on the price or value` IS
    `s 216 a reasonable person would be taken to expect the information to have a material effect on the price or value` `the information would, or would be likely to, influence the persons who commonly invest in deciding whether or not to subscribe for, buy or sell the securities, contracts or units` `the information would, or would be likely to, influence one or more classes of the persons who commonly invest in deciding whether or not to subscribe for, buy or sell the securities, contracts or units`

@export Under section 218(5)(a), am I a connected person?
GIVEN
    `the person is a person referred to in subsection (1) or (1A) of section 218` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a person referred to in section 218(1) or (1A)?
    `the person is connected to the corporation (the answer under section 218(5)(b))` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the question under section 218(5)(b) answer in your case? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE or NOTHING)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 218(5)(a), am I a connected person` IS
    `s 218(5)(a) the person is a connected person` `the person is a person referred to in subsection (1) or (1A) of section 218` `the person is connected to the corporation (the answer under section 218(5)(b))`

@export Under section 218(1), do subsections (2), (3), (4), (5) and (6) of section 218 apply to me as a connected person?
GIVEN
    `the person is connected to the corporation (the answer under section 218(5)(b))` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the question under section 218(5)(b) answer in your case? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE or NOTHING)
    `the person possesses information concerning the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you possess information concerning the corporation?
    `the information is generally available (the answer under section 215)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the question under section 215 answer for this information? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE or NOTHING)
    `a reasonable person would expect the information, if generally available, to have a material effect on the price or value of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of the corporation (the answer under section 216)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the question under section 216 answer for this information, read for securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of the corporation? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE or NOTHING)
    `the connected person knows or ought reasonably to know that the information is not generally available` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know, or ought you reasonably to know, that the information is not generally available?
    `the connected person knows or ought reasonably to know that, if generally available, the information might have a material effect on the price or value of those securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know, or ought you reasonably to know, that, if it were generally available, the information might have a material effect on the price or value of those securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of the corporation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 218(1), do subsections (2), (3), (4), (5) and (6) of section 218 apply to me as a connected person` IS
    `s 218(1) subsections (2), (3), (4), (5) and (6) apply to the connected person` `the person is connected to the corporation (the answer under section 218(5)(b))` `the person possesses information concerning the corporation` `the information is generally available (the answer under section 215)` `a reasonable person would expect the information, if generally available, to have a material effect on the price or value of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of the corporation (the answer under section 216)` `the connected person knows or ought reasonably to know that the information is not generally available` `the connected person knows or ought reasonably to know that, if generally available, the information might have a material effect on the price or value of those securities or securities-based derivatives contracts`

@export Under section 218(2), does my dealing or procuring contravene the bar on a connected person dealing while in possession of inside information?
GIVEN
    `subsection (2) applies to the person (the answer under section 218(1) or (1A))` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the question under section 218(1) or (1A) answer in your case? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE or NOTHING)
    `the connected person subscribed for, purchased or sold, or entered into an agreement to subscribe for, purchase or sell, the securities, contracts or units, whether as principal or agent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you (whether as principal or agent) subscribe for, purchase or sell, or enter into an agreement to subscribe for, purchase or sell, the securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or CIS units?
    `the connected person procured another person to subscribe for, purchase or sell, or to enter into an agreement to subscribe for, purchase or sell, the securities, contracts or units` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you (whether as principal or agent) procure another person to subscribe for, purchase or sell, or to enter into an agreement to subscribe for, purchase or sell, the securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or CIS units?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 218(2), does my dealing or procuring contravene the bar on a connected person dealing while in possession of inside information` IS
    `s 218(2) the connected person's dealing or procuring contravenes the bar` `subsection (2) applies to the person (the answer under section 218(1) or (1A))` `the connected person subscribed for, purchased or sold, or entered into an agreement to subscribe for, purchase or sell, the securities, contracts or units, whether as principal or agent` `the connected person procured another person to subscribe for, purchase or sell, or to enter into an agreement to subscribe for, purchase or sell, the securities, contracts or units`

@export Under section 218(3), does my communication of the information contravene the bar on a connected person communicating inside information?
GIVEN
    `subsection (3) applies to the person (the answer under section 218(1) or (1A))` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the question under section 218(1) or (1A) answer in your case? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE or NOTHING)
    `the connected person communicated the information, or caused it to be communicated, directly or indirectly, to another person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you, directly or indirectly, communicate the information, or cause it to be communicated, to another person?
    `the connected person knows, or ought reasonably to know, that the other person would or would be likely to deal in or procure dealing in the securities, contracts or units` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know, or ought you reasonably to know, that the other person would or would be likely to subscribe for, purchase or sell, or enter into an agreement to subscribe for, purchase or sell, the securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or CIS units, or procure a third person to?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 218(3), does my communication of the information contravene the bar on a connected person communicating inside information` IS
    `s 218(3) the connected person's communication of the information contravenes the bar` `subsection (3) applies to the person (the answer under section 218(1) or (1A))` `the connected person communicated the information, or caused it to be communicated, directly or indirectly, to another person` `the connected person knows, or ought reasonably to know, that the other person would or would be likely to deal in or procure dealing in the securities, contracts or units`

@export Under section 218(4), am I presumed to have known that the information was not generally available and material?
GIVEN
    `the proceedings are for a contravention of section 218(2) or (3) against a person connected to a corporation referred to in subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the proceedings for a contravention of section 218(2) or (3) against a person connected to a corporation referred to in section 218(1)?
    `the prosecution or claimant proves that the connected person was at the material time in possession of information concerning the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the prosecution or claimant prove that you were at the material time in possession of information concerning the corporation to which you were connected?
    `the prosecution or claimant proves that the information was not generally available` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the prosecution or claimant prove that the information was not generally available?
    `the contrary is proved` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the contrary been proved?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 218(4), am I presumed to have known that the information was not generally available and material` IS
    `s 218(4) the connected person is presumed to have known that the information was not generally available and might have a material effect` `the proceedings are for a contravention of section 218(2) or (3) against a person connected to a corporation referred to in subsection (1)` `the prosecution or claimant proves that the connected person was at the material time in possession of information concerning the corporation` `the prosecution or claimant proves that the information was not generally available` `the contrary is proved`

