    `a reasonable person would expect the information, if generally available, to have a material effect on the price or value of securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or CIS units (the answer under section 216)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the question under section 216 answer for this information, read for the securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or CIS units concerned? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE or NOTHING)
    `the insider knows that the information is not generally available` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know that the information is not generally available?
    `the insider knows that, if generally available, the information might have a material effect on the price or value of those securities, contracts or units` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know that, if it were generally available, the information might have a material effect on the price or value of those securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or CIS units?
