    `the action is for a contravention of section 218(3) or 219(3) because the person communicated information, or caused information to be communicated, to another person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the action against you for a contravention of section 218(3) or 219(3) because you communicated information, or caused information to be communicated, to another person?
    `the information came into the person's possession solely as a result of its having been made known as referred to in section 215(b)(i)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the court satisfied that the information came into your possession solely as a result of the information having been made known as referred to in section 215(b)(i)?
    `the other person knew, or ought reasonably to have known, of the information before it was communicated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the court satisfied that the other person knew, or ought reasonably to have known, of the information before the information was communicated?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
