    `s 231(2) the person has the parity of information defence to the contravention by communicating` `the action is for a contravention of section 218(3) or 219(3) because the person communicated information, or caused information to be communicated, to another person` `the information came into the person's possession solely as a result of its having been made known as referred to in section 215(b)(i)` `the other person knew, or ought reasonably to have known, of the information before it was communicated`

