    `s 268A(2) the semi-annual report is lodged with the trustee in time` `the 6 months covered by the report ended on` `I lodged the report with the trustee on`


§§ `Section 269: the guarantor entity`

@export Under section 269(2), must the guarantor entity provide the borrowing entity with the information it asked for?
GIVEN `the borrowing entity has required the information by written notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the borrowing entity required the information from the guarantor entity by written notice under section 269(1)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 269(2), must the guarantor entity provide the borrowing entity with the information` MEANS
    `s 269(2) the guarantor entity must provide the borrowing entity with the information` `the borrowing entity has required the information by written notice`

@export Under section 269(3), am I guilty of an offence because the guarantor entity failed to provide the information?
GIVEN `the guarantor entity fails to comply with the requirement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the guarantor entity fail to comply with a requirement contained in a notice under section 269(1)?
      `I am the guarantor entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the guarantor entity?
      `I am an officer or equivalent person of the guarantor entity in default` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an officer or equivalent person of the guarantor entity who is in default?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 269(3), am I guilty of an offence because the guarantor entity failed to provide the information` MEANS
    `s 269(3) the person is guilty of an offence` `the guarantor entity fails to comply with the requirement` `I am the guarantor entity` `I am an officer or equivalent person of the guarantor entity in default`


§§ `Section 270: loans and deposits repayable on demand`

@export Under section 270(3), may the trustee give written notice requiring the borrowing entity to repay the moneys?
GIVEN `a time was stated in the prospectus within which the purpose or project is to be achieved or completed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the prospectus state a time within which the purpose or project is to be achieved or completed?
      `it appears to the trustee that the purpose or project has not been achieved or completed within the time stated in the prospectus` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it appear to the trustee that the purpose or project has not been achieved or completed within the time stated in the prospectus?
      `it appears to the trustee that the purpose or project has not been achieved or completed within a reasonable time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it appear to the trustee that the purpose or project has not been achieved or completed within a reasonable time?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 270(3), may the trustee give written notice requiring the borrowing entity to repay the moneys` MEANS
    `s 270(3) the trustee may give written notice requiring the borrowing entity to repay the moneys` `a time was stated in the prospectus within which the purpose or project is to be achieved or completed` `it appears to the trustee that the purpose or project has not been achieved or completed within the time stated in the prospectus` `it appears to the trustee that the purpose or project has not been achieved or completed within a reasonable time`

@export Under section 270(5), is the borrowing entity liable to repay the moneys I lent or deposited?
GIVEN `the borrowing entity has received a notice requiring repayment from the trustee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the borrowing entity received a notice referred to in section 270(3)?
      `the moneys are owing to me as the result of a loan or deposit made in response to the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the moneys owing to you as the result of a loan or deposit you made in response to the offer?
      `before the moneys were accepted the borrowing entity gave written notice specifying the purpose or project, and accepted the moneys accordingly` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before the moneys were accepted, did the borrowing entity give written notice to the persons the moneys were received from specifying the purpose or project, and accept the moneys accordingly?
      `by written notice served on the holders the borrowing entity specified the purpose or project for which the moneys would in fact be applied` IS A BOOLEAN @desc By written notice served on the holders of the debentures, did the borrowing entity specify the purpose or project for which the moneys would in fact be applied?
      `by that notice the borrowing entity offered to repay the moneys to the holders` IS A BOOLEAN @desc By that notice, did the borrowing entity offer to repay the moneys to the holders of the debentures?
      `I demanded repayment from the borrowing entity in writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you demand repayment from the borrowing entity in writing?
      `I received the borrowing entity's notice on` IS A DATE @desc On what day did you receive the borrowing entity's notice?
      `I demanded repayment in writing on` IS A DATE @desc On what day did you demand repayment in writing? (Any date if you did not.)
      `the longer time the notice specified, in days` IS A NUMBER @desc If the notice specified a time longer than 14 days to demand repayment, how many days? (0 if it specified none.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 270(5), is the borrowing entity liable to repay the moneys I lent or deposited` MEANS
    `s 270(5) the borrowing entity is liable to repay the moneys` `the borrowing entity has received a notice requiring repayment from the trustee` `the moneys are owing to me as the result of a loan or deposit made in response to the offer` `before the moneys were accepted the borrowing entity gave written notice specifying the purpose or project, and accepted the moneys accordingly` `by written notice served on the holders the borrowing entity specified the purpose or project for which the moneys would in fact be applied` `by that notice the borrowing entity offered to repay the moneys to the holders` `I demanded repayment from the borrowing entity in writing` `I received the borrowing entity's notice on` `I demanded repayment in writing on` `the longer time the notice specified, in days`


§§ `Section 271: provisions exempting the trustee from liability`

@export Under section 271(1), is the provision in the trust deed that exempts the trustee from liability void?
GIVEN `the provision is contained in a trust deed relating to or securing an issue of debentures, or in a contract with the holders` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the provision contained in a trust deed relating to or securing an issue of debentures, or in a contract with the holders of debentures secured by a trust deed?
      `the provision would have the effect of exempting the trustee from, or indemnifying the trustee against, liability for breach of trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would the provision have the effect of exempting the trustee from, or indemnifying the trustee against, liability for breach of trust?
      `the trustee fails to show the degree of care and diligence required as trustee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the trustee fail to show the degree of care and diligence required as trustee?
      `the release was otherwise validly given in respect of anything the trustee did or omitted before it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the release otherwise validly given, in respect of anything done or omitted to be done by the trustee before the giving of the release?
      `the provision enables such a release to be given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the provision enable such a release to be given?
      `the nominal value of the debentures held by the holders who agree` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the nominal value of the debentures held by the holders who agree to the release, in Singapore dollars?
      `the nominal value of the debentures held by the holders present and voting` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the nominal value of the debentures held by the holders present and voting in person (or, where proxies are permitted, by proxy) at the meeting summoned for the purpose, in Singapore dollars?
      `the release is with respect to specific acts or omissions, or on the dissolution of the trustee or its ceasing to act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the release with respect to specific acts or omissions, or on the dissolution of the trustee or on the trustee's ceasing to act?
      `the provision was in force on 29 December 1967` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the provision in force on 29 December 1967?
      `a trustee then entitled to the benefit of the provision remains a trustee of the deed in question` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does a trustee who was then entitled to the benefit of the provision remain a trustee of the deed in question?
      `the trustee had an exemption or right to be indemnified for something done or omitted while the provision was in force` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the trustee have an exemption or a right to be indemnified in respect of anything done or omitted to be done by the trustee while the provision was in force?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 271(1), is the provision in the trust deed that exempts the trustee from liability void` MEANS
    `s 271(1) the provision is void` `the provision is contained in a trust deed relating to or securing an issue of debentures, or in a contract with the holders` `the provision would have the effect of exempting the trustee from, or indemnifying the trustee against, liability for breach of trust` `the trustee fails to show the degree of care and diligence required as trustee` (`s 271(2) subsection (1) does not invalidate the release or the provision` `the release was otherwise validly given in respect of anything the trustee did or omitted before it` `the provision enables such a release to be given` `the nominal value of the debentures held by the holders who agree` `the nominal value of the debentures held by the holders present and voting` `the release is with respect to specific acts or omissions, or on the dissolution of the trustee or its ceasing to act`) (`s 271(3) subsection (1) does not operate against the provision or the trustee's exemption` `the provision was in force on 29 December 1967` `a trustee then entitled to the benefit of the provision remains a trustee of the deed in question` `the trustee had an exemption or right to be indemnified for something done or omitted while the provision was in force`)


§ `Part 13 Division 1 Subdivision (4): exemptions`


§§ `Section 272: issue or transfer for no consideration`

@export Under section 272(1), is my offer of shares or debentures, for which no consideration is given, exempt from the prospectus requirements?
GIVEN `my offer is an offer of shares or debentures of an entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer an offer of securities being shares or debentures of an entity?
      `consideration is or will be given for the issue or transfer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is consideration given, or will it be given, for the issue or transfer of the shares or debentures?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 272(1), is my offer of shares or debentures for no consideration exempt from the prospectus requirements` MEANS
    `s 272(1) the offer is exempt from Subdivisions (1A), (2) and (3) of this Division (other than section 257)` `my offer is an offer of shares or debentures of an entity` `consideration is or will be given for the issue or transfer`

@export Under section 272(2), is my offer of securities-based derivatives contracts, for which no consideration is given, exempt from the prospectus requirements?
GIVEN `my offer is an offer of securities-based derivatives contracts of the kind the section names` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer an offer of securities-based derivatives contracts that are units of shares or debentures, or derivatives of units in a business trust, or derivatives of shares or debentures?
      `consideration is or will be given for the units or contracts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is consideration given, or will it be given, for the issue or transfer of the contracts or the units?
      `consideration is or will be given for the underlying shares or debentures` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is consideration given, or will it be given, for the underlying shares or debentures?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 272(2), is my offer of securities-based derivatives contracts for no consideration exempt from the prospectus requirements` MEANS
    `s 272(2) the offer of securities-based derivatives contracts is exempt from Subdivisions (1A), (2) and (3) of this Division (other than section 257)` `my offer is an offer of securities-based derivatives contracts of the kind the section names` `consideration is or will be given for the units or contracts` `consideration is or will be given for the underlying shares or debentures`


§§ `Section 272A: small offers`

@export Under section 272A(1)(a), is the total amount I have raised from small offers within 12 months within the limit?
GIVEN `the total I have raised from these offers within the 12 months` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total amount you have raised from these offers within the period of 12 months, in dollars?
      `the Authority has prescribed another limit in place of $5 million` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Authority prescribed another amount in place of $5 million?
      `the other limit the Authority has prescribed` IS A NUMBER @desc What other amount has the Authority prescribed, in dollars? (Put 0 if none.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 272A(1)(a), is the total amount I have raised within 12 months within the limit` MEANS
    `s 272A(1)(a) the total amount raised within the period of 12 months does not exceed the limit` `the total I have raised from these offers within the 12 months` `the Authority has prescribed another limit in place of $5 million` `the other limit the Authority has prescribed`

@export Under section 272A(1)(c), is none of my offers accompanied by an advertisement?
GIVEN `one of my offers is accompanied by an advertisement making an offer or calling attention to it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is any of your offers accompanied by an advertisement making an offer or calling attention to the offer or intended offer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 272A(1)(c), is none of my offers accompanied by an advertisement` MEANS
    `s 272A(1)(c) none of the offers is accompanied by an advertisement` `one of my offers is accompanied by an advertisement making an offer or calling attention to it`


§§ `Section 272B: private placement`

@export Under section 272B(1)(a), have I offered to no more than the allowed number of persons within 12 months?
GIVEN `the number of persons my offers are made to within the 12 months` IS A NUMBER @desc To how many persons are your offers made within the period of 12 months (counting each person as section 272B(5) says)?
      `the Authority has prescribed another number of persons in place of 50` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Authority prescribed another number of persons in place of 50?
      `the other number of persons the Authority has prescribed` IS A NUMBER @desc What other number of persons has the Authority prescribed? (Put 0 if none.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 272B(1)(a), have I offered to no more than the allowed number of persons within 12 months` MEANS
    `s 272B(1)(a) the offers are made to no more than the applicable number of persons within the period of 12 months` `the number of persons my offers are made to within the 12 months` (`s 272B(2) the applicable number of persons` `the Authority has prescribed another number of persons in place of 50` `the other number of persons the Authority has prescribed`)


§§ `Section 273: offers made under certain circumstances`

@export Under section 273(1)(a), is my offer made in connection with a take-over offer made in compliance with the Take-over Code?
GIVEN `my offer is made in connection with a take-over offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer made in connection with a take-over offer?
      `the take-over offer is made in compliance with the Take-over Code` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the take-over offer made in compliance with the Singapore Code on Take-overs and Mergers?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 273(1)(a), is my offer made in connection with a take-over offer made in compliance with the Take-over Code` MEANS
    `s 273(1)(a) the offer is made in connection with a take-over offer in compliance with the Take-over Code` `my offer is made in connection with a take-over offer` `the take-over offer is made in compliance with the Take-over Code`

@export Under section 273(1)(ce), is my offer of listed shares or debentures made to existing holders?
GIVEN `my offer is an offer of shares or debentures of an entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer an offer of shares or debentures of an entity (or of SDRs of the kind the paragraph names)?
      `my offer is made to an existing member or debenture holder of the entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer made to an existing member or debenture holder of that entity?
      `the shares of the entity are listed for quotation on an approved exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares of the entity listed for quotation on an approved exchange?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 273(1)(ce), is my offer of listed shares or debentures made to existing holders` MEANS
    `s 273(1)(ce) the offer of shares or debentures is made to existing holders where the shares are listed` `my offer is an offer of shares or debentures of an entity` `my offer is made to an existing member or debenture holder of the entity` `the shares of the entity are listed for quotation on an approved exchange`

@export Under section 273(5), is my offer made within the 6 months from the Authority's declaration?
GIVEN `the Authority has declared that a prospectus may be dispensed with` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Authority, on the application of a person interested, declared that circumstances exist whereby the cost of providing a prospectus outweighs the protection to investors, or that a prospectus may be dispensed with without prejudice to the public interest?
      `the Authority made its declaration on` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the Authority make the declaration?
      `I make my offer on` IS A DATE @desc On what day do you make the offer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 273(5), is my offer made within the 6 months from the Authority's declaration` MEANS
    `s 273(5) the offer is within the period of 6 months from the date of the Authority's declaration` `the Authority has declared that a prospectus may be dispensed with` `the Authority made its declaration on` `I make my offer on`

@export Under section 273(8A), am I barred from advertising my offer, or publishing a statement about it, unless the advertisement or statement complies with the prescribed requirements?
GIVEN `I advertise my offer or intended offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you advertise the offer or intended offer?
      `I publish a statement that refers to my offer or intended offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you publish a statement that directly or indirectly refers to the offer or intended offer?
      `I publish a statement that is reasonably likely to induce persons to subscribe or purchase` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you publish a statement that is reasonably likely to induce persons to subscribe for or purchase the securities or contracts?
      `the advertisement or statement complies with the requirements prescribed by regulations` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the advertisement or statement comply with the requirements the Authority has prescribed by regulations made under section 341?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 273(8A), am I barred from advertising my offer or publishing a statement about it unless it complies with the prescribed requirements` MEANS
    `s 273(8A) the person must not advertise or publish what the subsection bars` `I advertise my offer or intended offer` `I publish a statement that refers to my offer or intended offer` `I publish a statement that is reasonably likely to induce persons to subscribe or purchase` `the advertisement or statement complies with the requirements prescribed by regulations`

@export Under section 273(8B), am I guilty of an offence for contravening section 273(8A) or knowingly permitting a prohibited advertisement or statement?
GIVEN `I contravene section 273(8A)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you contravene section 273(8A)?
      `I knowingly authorise or permit the publication of a prohibited advertisement or statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you knowingly authorise or permit the publication or dissemination of an advertisement or statement referred to in section 273(8A)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 273(8B), am I guilty of an offence for contravening section 273(8A) or knowingly permitting a prohibited advertisement` MEANS
    `s 273(8B) the person is guilty of an offence` `I contravene section 273(8A)` `I knowingly authorise or permit the publication of a prohibited advertisement or statement`


§§ `Section 274: offers to institutional investors`

@export Under section 274, is my offer to an institutional investor exempt from the prospectus requirements?
GIVEN `my offer is an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts (whether or not previously issued)?
      `the person I offer to is an institutional investor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person you offer to an institutional investor?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 274, is my offer to an institutional investor exempt from the prospectus requirements` MEANS
    `s 274 the offer is exempt from Subdivisions (1A), (2) and (3) of this Division (other than section 257)` `my offer is an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` (IF `the person I offer to is an institutional investor` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE)


§§ `Section 275: offers to relevant persons and accredited investors`

@export Under section 275(1), is my offer to a relevant person exempt from the prospectus requirements?
GIVEN `my offer is an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts?
      `the person I offer to is an accredited investor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person you offer to an accredited investor?
      `the person is a corporation the sole business of which is to hold investments` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a corporation the sole business of which is to hold investments and the entire share capital of which is owned by one or more accredited investors?
      `the entire share capital of the corporation is owned by accredited investors` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the entire share capital of that corporation owned by one or more persons who are accredited investors?
      `the person is the trustee of a trust whose sole purpose is to hold investments` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person the trustee of a trust the sole purpose of which is to hold investments?
      `each beneficiary of the trust is an accredited investor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is each beneficiary of that trust an individual who is an accredited investor?
      `the person is an officer or equivalent person of the person making the offer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person an officer or equivalent person of the person making the offer, or of the issuer?
      `the person is a spouse, parent, brother, sister, son or daughter of such an officer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a spouse, parent, brother, sister, son or daughter of such an officer or equivalent person?
      `my offer is accompanied by an advertisement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer accompanied by an advertisement making an offer or calling attention to it?
      `I pay or incur a selling or promotional expense other than the kinds the section allows` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you pay or incur any selling or promotional expense other than administrative or professional expenses or commissions or fees to a licensed or exempt dealer?
      `a prospectus for my offer has been registered by the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a prospectus in respect of the offer been registered by the Authority?
      `the registered prospectus has expired` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the registered prospectus expired under section 250?
      `I told the Authority before making the offer that the offer is made in reliance on section 275` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before making the offer, did you inform the Authority that the offer is made in reliance on section 275?
      `I took reasonable steps to tell the person offered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before making the offer, did you take reasonable steps to inform the person offered that the offer is made in reliance on section 275?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 275(1), is my offer to a relevant person exempt from the prospectus requirements` MEANS
    `s 275(1) the offer is exempt from Subdivisions (1A), (2) and (3) of this Division (other than section 257)` `my offer is an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` (`s 275(2) the person is a relevant person` (IF `the person I offer to is an accredited investor` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE) `the person is a corporation the sole business of which is to hold investments` `the entire share capital of the corporation is owned by accredited investors` `the person is the trustee of a trust whose sole purpose is to hold investments` `each beneficiary of the trust is an accredited investor` `the person is an officer or equivalent person of the person making the offer` `the person is a spouse, parent, brother, sister, son or daughter of such an officer`) (`s 275(1)(a) the offer is not accompanied by an advertisement` `my offer is accompanied by an advertisement`) (`s 275(1)(b) no selling or promotional expenses are paid or incurred other than those the paragraph allows` (IF `I pay or incur a selling or promotional expense other than the kinds the section allows` THEN LIST `s 272A(1)(d) any other selling or promotional expense` ELSE EMPTY)) (`s 275(1)(c) no prospectus is registered, or the registered prospectus has expired or the Authority and the offeree have been told` `a prospectus for my offer has been registered by the Authority` `the registered prospectus has expired` `I told the Authority before making the offer that the offer is made in reliance on section 275` `I took reasonable steps to tell the person offered`)


§§ `Section 276: sale of securities acquired under an exemption`

@export Under section 276(1), do the prospectus requirements apply to my offer to sell the securities I acquired under an exempt offer?
-- Section 276(7) is passed to subsection (1) as holding (JUST TRUE) when its own function says so and as not holding (JUST FALSE) otherwise: the person states the facts, and a case outside subsection (7) is a case where it does not apply.
GIVEN `I acquired the securities or contracts pursuant to an offer made in reliance on section 274 or 275` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you acquire the securities or contracts pursuant to an offer made in reliance on an exemption under section 274 or 275?
      `I sell the securities or contracts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you selling the securities or contracts (including the shares or units they converted into)?
      `I acquired them on` IS A DATE @desc On what day did you acquire the securities or contracts?
      `I sell them on` IS A DATE @desc On what day do you sell them?
      `the sale is to an institutional investor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the sale to an institutional investor?
      `the sale is to a relevant person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the sale to a relevant person (section 275(2))?
      `the sale is pursuant to an offer under section 275(1A)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the sale to a person pursuant to an offer referred to in section 275(1A)?
      `the securities are of a corporation and of the same class as securities listed on an approved exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the securities or contracts of a corporation and of the same class as other securities of that corporation that are listed for quotation on an approved exchange?
      `the units are units in a business trust or derivatives of them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the units in a business trust, or derivatives of units in a business trust, of the same class as listed units?
      `those other securities are listed for quotation on an approved exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are those other securities, contracts, units or derivatives listed for quotation on an approved exchange?
      `a prospectus or offer information statement was lodged or registered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a prospectus, offer information statement, introductory document, shareholder circular or similar document lodged or registered in respect of them?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 276(1), do the prospectus requirements apply to my offer to sell the securities I acquired under an exempt offer` MEANS
    `s 276(1) Subdivisions (1A), (2) and (3) of this Division apply to the offer resulting in the sale` `I acquired the securities or contracts pursuant to an offer made in reliance on section 274 or 275` `I sell the securities or contracts` `I acquired them on` `I sell them on` (IF `the sale is to an institutional investor` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE) (IF `the sale is to a relevant person` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE) `the sale is pursuant to an offer under section 275(1A)` (IF (`s 276(7) subsections (1), (3) and (4) do not apply to the securities or contracts acquired` `the securities are of a corporation and of the same class as securities listed on an approved exchange` `the units are units in a business trust or derivatives of them` `those other securities are listed for quotation on an approved exchange` `a prospectus or offer information statement was lodged or registered`) EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE)


§§ `Section 277: an offer made using an offer information statement`

@export Under section 277(1), is my offer of securities of a listed corporation, made using an offer information statement, exempt from the prospectus requirements?
-- Scope: an offer of securities issued by a corporation whose shares are listed (sub-paragraph (a)(ii)); the sub-paragraphs for units of a business trust, SDRs and derivatives of such units are asked as false here,
-- and paragraph (ab) is passed as not applying. Sub-paragraphs (a)(i), (ia), (iii) and (ab) have their own layer-1 functions for a caller who needs them.
GIVEN `the securities are of a kind the Authority has prescribed as excluded` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the securities or contracts of a kind the Authority has prescribed by regulations as outside this exemption?
      `the securities are issued by a corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the securities issued by a corporation?
      `the shares of the corporation are listed on an approved exchange, counting SDRs` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares of the corporation listed for quotation on an approved exchange (counting sponsored depositary receipts for them as section 277(1AA) says)?
      `the securities are units of shares or units of debentures` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the securities units of shares or units of debentures?
      `the issuer of the units is the issuer of those shares or debentures` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the issuer of the units the issuer of those shares or debentures?
      `an offer information statement relating to the offer is lodged with the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is an offer information statement relating to the offer lodged with the Authority?
      `the statement complies with the prescribed form and content` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the statement comply with the requirements as to form and content that the Authority has prescribed?
      `the offer is made in or accompanied by the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made in, or accompanied by, the offer information statement?
      `the offer is made using an automated teller machine` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made using an automated teller machine?
      `the offer is made using other prescribed electronic means` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made using other electronic means that the Authority has prescribed?
      `the machine or means indicates how to obtain a copy of the statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the machine or means indicate how a prospective subscriber or buyer can obtain a copy of the statement?
      `the machine or means indicates that the statement should be read first` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it indicate that the prospective subscriber or buyer should read the statement before submitting an application?
      `the indications are given before an application can be submitted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are those indications given before the prospective subscriber or buyer is enabled to submit any application?
      `I comply with the other requirements the Authority has prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you comply with such other requirements as the Authority has prescribed?
      `the statement was lodged on` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the offer information statement lodged with the Authority?
      `I make the offer on` IS A DATE @desc On what day do you make the offer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 277(1), is my offer of securities of a listed corporation made using an offer information statement exempt from the prospectus requirements` MEANS
