§§ `Sections 278 and 279: international debentures, Government and international financial institutions`

@export Under section 278(1), is my offer of debentures by a body incorporated outside Singapore exempt from the prospectus requirements?
GIVEN `my offer is an offer of debentures by a body incorporated in a country outside Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer an offer of debentures, or units of debentures, by a body incorporated in a country outside Singapore?
      `the offer is made by the holder of a capital markets services licence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made by the holder of a capital markets services licence to deal in capital markets products that are securities or securities-based derivatives contracts?
      `the offer is made by an exempt person under section 99(1)(a) or (b)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made by an exempt person under section 99(1)(a) or (b)?
      `the offer is made to investors the Authority has specified by order in the Gazette` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made to such institutional, professional or business investors as the Authority has specified by order in the Gazette?
      `the debentures are denominated in a currency other than the Singapore dollar` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the debentures, or units of debentures, denominated in a currency other than the Singapore dollar?
      `the lowest face value of any debenture in US dollars or the equivalent` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the lowest face value of any debenture, or unit of debenture, in the offer, in United States dollars (or its equivalent in another currency)?
      `the shares of the issuing corporation are listed on a recognised securities exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the shares of the issuing corporation listed on a recognised securities exchange?
      `the offer is guaranteed by a corporation whose shares are listed on a recognised securities exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer guaranteed by a corporation whose shares are listed on a recognised securities exchange?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 278(1), is my offer of debentures by a body incorporated outside Singapore exempt from the prospectus requirements` MEANS
    `s 278(1) the offer is exempt from Subdivisions (2) and (3) of this Division (other than section 257)` `my offer is an offer of debentures by a body incorporated in a country outside Singapore` (`s 278(1)(a) the offer is made by a licensee or an exempt person to the investors the Authority has specified` `the offer is made by the holder of a capital markets services licence` `the offer is made by an exempt person under section 99(1)(a) or (b)` `the offer is made to investors the Authority has specified by order in the Gazette`) (`s 278(1)(b) the offer complies with the conditions specified in subsection (2)` (`s 278(2) the offer complies with the conditions specified in this subsection` (`s 278(2)(a) the debentures are denominated in a foreign currency and each has a face value of at least US$5,000` `the debentures are denominated in a currency other than the Singapore dollar` `the lowest face value of any debenture in US dollars or the equivalent`) (`s 278(2)(b) the shares of the issuing corporation, or of a guarantor, are listed on a recognised securities exchange` `the shares of the issuing corporation are listed on a recognised securities exchange` `the offer is guaranteed by a corporation whose shares are listed on a recognised securities exchange`)))

@export Under section 279, is my offer of debentures made or guaranteed by the Government or an international financial institution exempt from the prospectus requirements?
GIVEN `my offer is an offer of debentures or units of debentures` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer an offer of debentures, or units of debentures?
      `the offer is made or guaranteed by the Government` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made by, or guaranteed by, the Government?
      `the offer is made or guaranteed by an international financial institution in which Singapore holds membership` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer made by, or guaranteed by, an international financial institution in which Singapore holds membership of any class or description?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 279, is my offer of debentures made or guaranteed by the Government or an international financial institution exempt from the prospectus requirements` MEANS
    `s 279 the offer is exempt from Subdivisions (2) and (3) of this Division` `my offer is an offer of debentures or units of debentures` `the offer is made or guaranteed by the Government` `the offer is made or guaranteed by an international financial institution in which Singapore holds membership`


§§ `Section 280: an offer made using an automated teller machine`

@export Under section 280(1), is my offer made using an automated teller machine exempted from the requirement of a prospectus or profile statement?
GIVEN `my offer is an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your offer an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts?
      `I make the offer using an automated teller machine` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you make the offer using an automated teller machine?
      `I make the offer using other electronic means the Authority has prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you make the offer using other electronic means that the Authority has prescribed?
      `I comply with the requirements the Authority has prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you comply with such requirements as the Authority has prescribed?
      `the machine or means indicates how to obtain a copy of the prospectus or profile statement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the machine or means indicate how a prospective subscriber or buyer can obtain a copy of the prospectus or profile statement?
      `the machine or means indicates that it should be read first` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it indicate that the prospective subscriber or buyer should read the prospectus or profile statement before submitting an application?
      `the indications are given before an application can be submitted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are those indications given before the prospective subscriber or buyer is enabled to submit any application?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 280(1), is my offer made using an automated teller machine exempted from the requirement of a prospectus or profile statement` MEANS
    `s 280(1) the person making the offer is exempted from the requirement of a prospectus or profile statement` (`s 280(1) the offer is an offer referred to in section 280` `my offer is an offer of securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` `I make the offer using an automated teller machine` `I make the offer using other electronic means the Authority has prescribed`) `I comply with the requirements the Authority has prescribed` (`s 280(3) the machine or the electronic means gives the indications that subsection (1) needs` `the machine or means indicates how to obtain a copy of the prospectus or profile statement` `the machine or means indicates that it should be read first` `the indications are given before an application can be submitted`)


