      `the liability is for a relevant offence under Division 2 of Part 12 of the Companies Act 1967 or Part 12 of the Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the liability, penalty, award of compensation or punishment in respect of a relevant offence under Division 2 of Part 12 of the Companies Act 1967 or Part 12 of the Act?
