      `what I did or left undone was in connection with complying with a direction issued to the trustee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the thing done (including any statement made) or left undone in the course of, or in connection with, complying (or purporting to comply) with a direction issued to the trustee under section 282AA(1)?
      `I acted with reasonable care` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act with reasonable care?
      `I acted in good faith` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act in good faith?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 282AA(5), do I incur no liability for what I did, as a trustee or for a trustee, in complying with a direction` MEANS
